Iranian Army Navy: Oil tanker violating regulations catches fire in the eastern Strait of Hormuz

Public Relations Department of the Iranian Army Navy: An oil tanker that had switched off its tracking systems and was attempting to pass through a restricted area in the eastern Strait of Hormuz sustained damage and caught fire before being identified by the Iranian Army Navy’s surveillance teams.

